[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4262.63, "timestamp": "01:11:02", "text": "ユーチューバーの友達が、ちょっと引きずり下ろした"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4265.27, "timestamp": "01:11:05", "text": "私を歌のデュエットコラボに誘うか、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4268.47, "timestamp": "01:11:08", "text": "何かが、私が落ち始めてから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4271.59, "timestamp": "01:11:11", "text": "歌うのが好きで、どうやって"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4274.63, "timestamp": "01:11:14", "text": "自分の感情を表現し、吐き出すことができる。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4277.11, "timestamp": "01:11:17", "text": "歌い方を知らなくても、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4279.189, "timestamp": "01:11:19", "text": "少なくとも最善を尽くして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4281.99, "timestamp": "01:11:21", "text": "外。それは表現の一形態だ。いいえ、そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4284.63, "timestamp": "01:11:24", "text": "私はそれが本当に好きです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4287.43, "timestamp": "01:11:27", "text": "うん。そしてあなたの質問に対しては、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4290.55, "timestamp": "01:11:30", "text": "最後だと思う"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4294.149, "timestamp": "01:11:34", "text": "えっと、火曜日か何か。私は試してみました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4296.47, "timestamp": "01:11:36", "text": "歌う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4298.149, "timestamp": "01:11:38", "text": "うん。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4306.87, "timestamp": "01:11:46", "text": "だって、好きですか？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4306.9, "timestamp": "01:11:46", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "that is so specific 😅"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4308.709, "timestamp": "01:11:48", "text": "質問に続いて、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4311.51, "timestamp": "01:11:51", "text": "えっと、人々と一緒に歌うこと以外にも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4314.31, "timestamp": "01:11:54", "text": "または、あなたが好きなもの、どのように"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4315.156, "timestamp": "01:11:55", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3